{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0076-minimum-window-substring","title":"LeetCode 76 最小覆盖子串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-comprehensive/lc0076-minimum-window-substring","wordCount":822,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-76-最小覆盖子串\">LeetCode 76 最小覆盖子串</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个字符串 <code>s</code> 和一个字符串 <code>t</code>，返回 <code>s</code> 中涵盖 <code>t</code> 所有字符的最小子串。如果 <code>s</code> 中不存在涵盖 <code>t</code> 所有字符的子串，返回空字符串 <code>&quot;&quot;</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;ADOBECODEBANC&quot;, t = &quot;ABC&quot;&#10;输出：&quot;BANC&quot;&#10;解释：最小覆盖子串 &quot;BANC&quot; 包含 t 中的 &#39;A&#39;、&#39;B&#39;、&#39;C&#39;&#10;&#10;输入：s = &quot;a&quot;, t = &quot;a&quot;&#10;输出：&quot;a&quot;&#10;&#10;输入：s = &quot;a&quot;, t = &quot;aa&quot;&#10;输出：&quot;&quot;&#10;解释：t 中有两个 &#39;a&#39;，s 中只有一个，无法覆盖\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"ADOBECODEBANC\", t = \"ABC\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"BANC\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最小覆盖子串 \"BANC\" 包含 t 中的 'A'、'B'、'C'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"a\", t = \"a\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"a\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"a\", t = \"aa\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：t 中有两个 'a'，s 中只有一个，无法覆盖</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length, t.length &lt;= 10⁵</code></li>\n<li><code>s</code> 和 <code>t</code> 由英文字母组成</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>这是滑动窗口的经典模板题，也是很多公司面试的高频题。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力思路：</strong> 枚举 <code>s</code> 的所有子串，检查每个子串是否覆盖 <code>t</code> 的所有字符，取最短的。时间复杂度 O(n² × m)，完全不可接受。</p>\n<p><strong>滑动窗口：</strong> 维护一个窗口 <code>[left, right)</code>，用右指针扩展窗口直到覆盖 <code>t</code>，然后收缩左指针寻找最小窗口。</p>\n<p><strong>关键数据结构：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>need</code>：记录 <code>t</code> 中每个字符的需求计数</li>\n<li><code>window</code>：记录当前窗口中每个字符的出现次数</li>\n<li><code>formed</code>：已满足需求的字符种类数</li>\n<li><code>required</code>：<code>t</code> 中不同字符的种类数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当 <code>formed === required</code> 时，窗口覆盖了 <code>t</code> 的所有字符。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扩展</td>\n<td>右指针右移，更新 window</td>\n<td>formed &lt; required</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记录</td>\n<td>更新最小窗口</td>\n<td>formed === required</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收缩</td>\n<td>左指针右移，更新 window</td>\n<td>formed === required</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止</td>\n<td>右指针到达末尾</td>\n<td>right === s.length</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>为什么滑动窗口有效？</strong> 因为当窗口已经覆盖 <code>t</code> 时，继续扩展右指针只会让窗口更大，不可能更优。因此应该收缩左指针。而当窗口不覆盖 <code>t</code> 时，收缩左指针只会更差，应该扩展右指针。这种单调性保证了左右指针都只向右移动，总共移动 2n 次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function minWindow(s: string, t: string): string {&#10;  if (s.length &lt; t.length) return &#39;&#39;;&#10;&#10;  const need = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;  for (const c of t) {&#10;    need.set(c, (need.get(c) ?? 0) + 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const window = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;  let formed = 0;&#10;  const required = need.size;&#10;&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let minLen = Infinity;&#10;  let minStart = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let right = 0; right &lt; s.length; right++) {&#10;    const c = s[right];&#10;    window.set(c, (window.get(c) ?? 0) + 1);&#10;&#10;    if (need.has(c) &amp;&amp; window.get(c) === need.get(c)) {&#10;      formed++;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    while (formed === required) {&#10;      const windowLen = right - left + 1;&#10;      if (windowLen &lt; minLen) {&#10;        minLen = windowLen;&#10;        minStart = left;&#10;      }&#10;&#10;      const leftChar = s[left];&#10;      window.set(leftChar, window.get(leftChar)! - 1);&#10;&#10;      if (need.has(leftChar) &amp;&amp; window.get(leftChar)! &lt; need.get(leftChar)!) {&#10;        formed--;&#10;      }&#10;&#10;      left++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return minLen === Infinity ? &#39;&#39; : s.slice(minStart, minStart + minLen);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> minWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"col